<title>JAPAN: S&amp;B - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>S&amp;B - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 45.95		vs	   44.31</p>
<p> Operating	    1.24		vs	    1.29</p>
<p> Current	    991    million    vs	  942    million</p>
<p> Net		  451    million    vs	  402    million</p>
<p> EPS		   12.95 yen	  vs	   11.53 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     35 million	  vs	  35 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - S&amp;B Shokuhin Co Ltd is a top producer of instant seasonings.</p>
